                    PRESENTS A NEW MAJOR PRODUCT >:

   Conference Top Uploaders v2.2 (Door) for Amiexpress BBS (Release 1)
   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
         Authers: BOBO & LOOBY   Favourite Board: The East BBS
          Door Requirements: AmigaDOS2.0 & Amiexpress 2.(33?)

                 This documentation is written by BOBO!

  Program history and example outputs/scripts come in seperate files with
                          the release archive.


           Notable features on Conference Top Uploaders...
           ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
        * Built in Config Program (Easy to set up and modify)
        * Works without conference accounting.
        * Configable: Write message to EALL or other user when reseting.
        * Configable: Write bulletine when reseting.
        * AmiExpress compatible with all amiexpress versions above 2.33.
        * Online Updating.
        * Multi-node compatible.
        * Very FAST!
        * Special Optimized Versions for all CPU types (000/010/020/030/040)
        * Lot's of secuirty checks. Nothing can go wrong!

   Conference Top Uploaders have been tested on the following setups
                  without any sort of problems.. :

       A2000 (68030/50Mhz) OS 2.0 - Amiexpress v3.32 (BOBO/MYSTIC)
       A3000 (68030/25Mhz) OS 3.0 - Amiexpress v3.12 (SLASH/MAGIC 12)
       A3000 (68030/25Mhz) OS 2.0 - Amiexpress v3.32 (BYTEANDI/MYSTIC)
       A3000 (68030/25Mhz) OS 2.0 - Amiexpress v3.12 (UFFE)
       A4000 (68030/25Mhz) OS 3.0 - S-Express v0.33  (CEVIN KEY)
       A4000 (68040/25Mhz) OS 3.0 - Amiexpress v3.18 (NIGHTSHADE)

           More beta-testers wanted for future versions.

     Suggestions, Ideas and bug reports are welcome and wanted!


